From: macos-local research
Subject: [PATCH] Blend mandatory framebuffer fetch source-over in its ordered interlock

Keep ordinary attachment blending unchanged except the native-window BGRA8Unorm
premultiplied source-over form, alongside the existing half-float source-over path.
The storage form retains the current destination through source-over, depth/stencil
test gating and write-mask preservation. Precision notes remain in force.

